Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 10:03:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 24/29] refactor(vfs/stats): extract .stats renderer into
 stats_render
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Partial #12 (gqf2008/brewfs)

Sixth slice: move the ~800-line Prometheus-style render() into
src/vfs/stats_render.rs as a pure function over FsStats (self -> stats,
ORD reused). stats.rs now delegates with a one-liner. Pure code motion —
no behavior change; stats tests pass.
